  "description": {
    "text": "The Eevee-GX Box Set (伊布GX套装礼盒) was five gift boxes, one each for Sylveon, Leafeon, Glaceon, Espeon and Umbreon. Sylveon's came out on 6 January 2023, Leafeon's and Glaceon's on 11 January, and Espeon's and Umbreon's on 13 January. Each held its Pokémon's GX card, a rainbow card, with one of three basic Eevee-GX cards at random, matching sleeves and a binder, three 25-card Storming Emergence packs (one each of Radiant, Verdant and Abundant) and three six-card Battle Elite packs.\n\nTwo of the Eevee-GX cards have regular art and the third special art; Pokémon packed them at a ratio of 2:2:1.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Eevee-GX Box Sets coming soon (26 December 2022)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/16348.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSMYC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 008",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Eevee-GX Box Sets coming soon (26 December 2022)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/16348.html"
